    <string name="ay_api_guide">Free key guide (step by step)</string>
    <string name="ay_api_key_builtin_hint">Not needed — the built-in free Gemini key is active</string>
    <string name="guide_gemini">FREE Gemini key (recommended — no code needed; the app already ships a built-in key):\n\n1) Go to aistudio.google.com\n2) Sign in with your Google account (free)\n3) Click \"Get API key\" in the left menu\n4) Click \"Create API key\" → copy the key (starts with AIza…)\n5) Paste it here → Test → Save\n\nThe free daily quota is usually enough; NO credit card required.</string>
    <string name="guide_openrouter">FREE OpenRouter key (many free models):\n\n1) Go to openrouter.ai\n2) Sign in (Google/GitHub)\n3) Click Keys → \"Create Key\" in the left menu\n4) Copy the key (starts with sk-or-…)\n5) Paste it here → Test → Save\n6) Enter a free model in the model field (e.g. \"deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324:free\" — pick from openrouter.ai/models)</string>
    <string name="guide_openai">OpenAI key (paid service — use carefully):\n\n1) Go to platform.openai.com\n2) Sign up / sign in\n3) Go to API keys → \"Create new secret key\"\n4) Copy the key (starts with sk-…)\n5) Paste it here → Test → Save\n\n⚠ OpenAI quotas are PAID; choose Gemini or OpenRouter for free usage.</string>
    <string name="guide_custom">Custom server (OpenAI-compatible — Ollama, LM Studio, vLLM, LocalAI):\n\n1) Run a local server like Ollama/LM Studio on your computer\n2) Enter its address (e.g. http://192.168.1.4:11434/v1/chat/completions)\n3) Enter the server API key (type \"ollama\" if none)\n4) Enter the model name (e.g. llama3.1)\n5) Test → Save\n\nPhone and computer must be on the same Wi-Fi network.</string>
    <string name="guide_open_link">Open in browser: %1$s</string>

